// ********************************* STAGE 2: THE SICKNESS *********************************

title: Shiekh_Khaled_stage2
tags: 
---
<<declare $shiekh_dead = false>>
<<declare $stage2_completed = false>>
<<declare $has_green_pill = false>>
<<declare $has_red_pill = false>>
<<declare $quest_fetch_pill = false>>

// Initial Condition: Check if we already did this
<<if $shiekh_dead == true>>
    <<jump Stage3_Bad_Ghost>>
<<endif>>

<<if $stage2_completed == true>>
    <<jump Shiekh_Khaled_stage3_Good>>
<<endif>>

// START STAGE 2
Old Khaled: ...*heavy breathing*... *cough*...
Old Khaled: Young one... the candle... it flickers in the wind...
    -> "Sheikh Khaled! Are you okay?"
        <<gesture anxious>>
        Old Khaled: My heart... it feels heavy... like a stone.
    -> "Do you need help?"
        <<gesture offer>>
        Old Khaled: ...Yes... I need my medicine... quickly...

Old Khaled: Listen to me closely... my vision blurs...
Old Khaled: Go to the bathroom cabinet...
Old Khaled: There is a **Green Bottle**... looks like the leaves of a fresh olive tree.
Old Khaled: **Do NOT** touch the Red one... it is for... a different ailment... it is poison for my heart now.
Old Khaled: Please... hurry... bring the **Green** one...

// Set a quest state here in your game manager if needed
<<set $quest_fetch_pill = true>>
===

// ********************************* STAGE 2: RETURN WITH PILL *********************************
// Call this node when the player returns and interacts with the Sheikh again

title: Shiekh_Khaled_PillReturn
---
Old Khaled: ...*gasping*... did you... find it?

// CHECK INVENTORY VARIABLES
<<if $has_green_pill == true>>
    -> "Here is the Green bottle, as you asked."
        <<gesture offer>>
        Old Khaled: ...*shaking hands*... Alhamdulilah...
        Old Khaled: ...*swallows pill*...
        <<wait 2>>
        Old Khaled: ...*breathing stabilizes*...
        Old Khaled: ...You listened... you paid attention to the details...
        Old Khaled: Just like a believer must pay attention to the signs...
        
        // REWARDS
        <<set $lightHeartLevel = $lightHeartLevel + 20>>
        <<set $shiekh_dead = false>>
        <<set $stage2_completed = true>>
        <<jump Shiekh_Khaled_stage3_Good>>

<<elseif $has_red_pill == true>>
    -> "I found this Red bottle."
        <<gesture offer>>
        Old Khaled: ...Red?... No... *cough*...
        Old Khaled: ...I told you... the green...
        Old Khaled: ...Why... why didn't you listen?...
        Old Khaled: ...The darkness... it comes...
        
        // DEATH CONSEQUENCE
        Old Khaled: ...*eyes close slowly*...
        ...
        (Sheikh Khaled has passed away.)
        
        // PUNISHMENT
        <<set $lightHeartLevel = $lightHeartLevel - 50>>
        <<set $shiekh_dead = true>>
        <<set $stage2_completed = true>>
        <<jump Stage3_Bad_Intro>>

<<else>>
    -> "I couldn't find anything."
        Old Khaled: ...Please... look again... green... cabinet...
<<endif>>
===